    <h2>Article 1 — Purpose</h2>
    <p>These Terms of Use govern access to and use of <a href="https://www.gfi-co.net/">www.gfi-co.net</a>, published by GFI-CO SARL. The website presents the company, its activities, services and projects, and allows visitors to request information or contact the company. These terms apply to anyone viewing the website or using its features.</p>

